    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "It’s been a few days since we released something new into the world.⁠\n⁠\nAtticus x Inked: Inner Voice Tattoos.⁠\n⁠\nAnd already, we’ve seen the words you’ve chosen to carry—quiet reminders like “I am enough,” “made of magic,” and “stay wild,” turning into something a little more permanent in feeling, even if they’re only temporary on skin.⁠\n⁠\nThat’s what this collection was meant to be. Not decoration, but reflection. Not just ink, but intention.⁠\n⁠\nIf you haven’t explored it yet, it’s still here for you—for a little while longer.⁠ Link in bio. \n⁠\nWear your words xx",
